{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00008",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.22,
      "end_seconds": 3.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Afternoon. Take the chair by the desk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.93,
      "end_seconds": 5.63,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hi."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.72,
      "end_seconds": 8.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Lovely day outside, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.1,
      "end_seconds": 12.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "It is, I almost forgot I was coming here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.0,
      "end_seconds": 15.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Tell me what's been troubling you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.43,
      "end_seconds": 20.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Well, I've been having blood in my urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.31,
      "end_seconds": 31.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.6,
      "end_seconds": 38.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.76,
      "text": "It's been going on for two weeks. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.91,
      "end_seconds": 42.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.42,
      "end_seconds": 57.44,
      "duration_seconds": 14.02,
      "text": "So, not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.2,
      "end_seconds": 61.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Have you had any flank pain or recent injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.25,
      "end_seconds": 65.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "No flank pain or recent injury, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.1,
      "end_seconds": 69.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Okay. Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.35,
      "end_seconds": 82.55,
      "duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.15,
      "end_seconds": 86.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.39,
      "end_seconds": 89.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Right, my father was diabetic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.88,
      "end_seconds": 93.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.98,
      "end_seconds": 96.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.74,
      "end_seconds": 104.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.52,
      "end_seconds": 108.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "No, uh, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.89,
      "end_seconds": 115.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.68,
      "end_seconds": 118.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.68,
      "end_seconds": 119.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.24,
      "end_seconds": 123.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "No, I don't take anything regularly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.03,
      "end_seconds": 136.82,
      "duration_seconds": 11.79,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.37,
      "end_seconds": 140.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.57,
      "end_seconds": 143.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.88,
      "end_seconds": 147.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.56,
      "end_seconds": 150.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.04,
      "end_seconds": 165.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.84,
      "end_seconds": 185.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 79, temperature 37.0, saturation 98 percent, BP is 108 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.01,
      "end_seconds": 188.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.68,
      "end_seconds": 208.87,
      "duration_seconds": 19.19,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.1,
      "end_seconds": 212.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Right, okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.17,
      "end_seconds": 217.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.63,
      "end_seconds": 219.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.86,
      "end_seconds": 223.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.25,
      "end_seconds": 233.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Abdomen is soft, no masses, and no tenderness in the loins."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.36,
      "end_seconds": 259.79,
      "duration_seconds": 21.43,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.44,
      "end_seconds": 262.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.82,
      "end_seconds": 275.4,
      "duration_seconds": 11.58,
      "text": "Putting it all together, this looks most like blood in the urine that needs full investigation. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.35,
      "end_seconds": 278.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.38,
      "end_seconds": 299.99,
      "duration_seconds": 20.61,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's blood in the urine that needs full investigation, and we'll know more once the a cystoscopy is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had blood in your urine for two weeks, and no flank pain or recent injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.96,
      "end_seconds": 306.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "So, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.83,
      "end_seconds": 309.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.54,
      "end_seconds": 311.38,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.24,
      "end_seconds": 346.28,
      "duration_seconds": 23.04,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. I'd like to arrange a cystoscopy for haematuria. Keep drinking plenty of water, and let us know quickly if you pass clots or can't pass urine. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. We'll refer you to the urology clinic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.81,
      "end_seconds": 356.97,
      "duration_seconds": 9.16,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if you can't pass urine or pass large clots, call us the same day or go to emergency. Come back in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.48,
      "end_seconds": 361.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.96,
      "end_seconds": 367.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.81,
      "end_seconds": 372.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "So, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.45,
      "end_seconds": 378.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Call the clinic if you need us in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.52,
      "end_seconds": 381.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Alright, thanks. Bye for now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.13,
      "end_seconds": 383.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}